  /// delivery of message via SMS sqs – delivery of JSON-encoded message to
  /// an Amazon SQS queue application – delivery of JSON-encoded message to
  /// an EndpointArn for a mobile app and device lambda – delivery of
  /// JSON-encoded message to an Lambda function firehose – delivery of
  /// JSON-encoded message to an Amazon Data Firehose delivery stream.
