  /// message attributes. MessageBody – The filter is applied on the message
  /// body. RawMessageDelivery – When set to true , enables raw message
  /// delivery to Amazon SQS or HTTP/S endpoints. This eliminates the need for
  /// the endpoints to process JSON formatting, which is otherwise created for
  /// Amazon SNS metadata. RedrivePolicy – When specified, sends
  /// undeliverable messages to the specified Amazon SQS dead-letter queue.
